'''Blossom''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing the [[2026 Valentine's Box]] for 30 [[Heart Gems]] [[File:Heart Gem.png|25x25px]] or 60 [[Diamonds|Gems]] [[File:Diamond_icon.png|25x25px]] during the [[Valentines Event 2026|2026 Valentine's Day Event]].

== Appearance ==
The handle is pink with various sized cherry blossom flowers on it, hence the name. The guard is also pink and the handle is solid black.
